      "content": "늦은 밤의 연습실",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "The late-night practice room",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "abb2fa05-9fa1-5251-b22f-da3b0553ff2d",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "content": "밤늦게 연습실에 불이 켜져 있다.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "The practice room light is still on late at night.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "63ecfa53-013d-562a-85ae-b998a3659be2",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 5,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "아, 감독님… 잠이 안 와서요. 뭔가 잡힐 것 같아요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Oh, Coach… I couldn't sleep. I feel like something's about to click.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "529b99c4-0cfd-5a28-9edb-7ec8dbdc4539",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 6,
      "x": 340,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "text": "사건 이벤트 설정",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
